<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria's WAPCO 6-mth profit down.</title>
<headline>Nigeria's WAPCO 6-mth profit down.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year profit for West African Portland Cement (WAPCO) to end-June.</p>
<p>			(In million naira)</p>
<p>			     1996	 1995</p>
<p>Turnover		   4,600	4,200</p>
<p>Profit before taxation 1,200	1,800</p>
<p>Taxation		     364.4	647.6</p>
<p>Profit after taxation    850.3    1,200</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>--Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
